2. What will be the output of the following 'c' code?
struct student
{
char *c;
};
void main()
{
struct student *s;
s = c = "hello";
printf("%s", s->c);
}
(A) hello
(B) Segmentation fault
(C) Run time error
(D) Nothing [1]

